{"step_index":759,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T18:03:55Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":true,"Summary":"Implementation plan for integrating MATLAB ANN surrogate metamodels into the platform as a real-time Digital Twin and Predictive Optimization Engine.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Digital Twin & ANN Surrogate Engine Implementation Plan\n\nIntegrate the user's MATLAB Artificial Neural Network (`.m`) surrogate metamodels into the platform as an interactive **Digital Twin & Real-Time Predictive Simulation Engine**.\n\n## User Review Required\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The MATLAB ANN models are ported directly into pure Python / NumPy with zero MATLAB runtime dependency. All mathematical operations (input scaling, 10-neuron hyperbolic tangent hidden layer, linear output layer, and reverse scaling) match the exact IEEE floating-point outputs from MATLAB Neural Network Toolbox `genFunction`.\n\n## Proposed Changes\n\n### Core Metamodel & Digital Twin Module\n\n#### [NEW] [ann_surrogate.py](file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/neurax_app/modules/ann_surrogate.py)\n- **MATLAB `.m` AST/Regex Parser**: Parses any `genFunction` `.m` file dynamically, extracting normalization parameters (`xoffset`, `gain`, `ymin`), weight matrices (`IW1_1`, `LW2_1`), and biases (`b1`, `b2`).\n- **Vectorized NumPy Inference Engine**: Runs single-sample or batch inference ($\\approx 0.05\\text{ms}$ latency).\n- **Pre-configured Model Registry**:\n  - `Model 1 Multi-Station Metamodel` (Station 1, Station 2, Station 3)\n  - `Model 2 Multi-Station Metamodel` (Drilling, Milling, Assembly)\n  - `Model 2 Dedicated Station Metamodels` (`Drilling`, `Milling`, `Assembly`)\n  - `Combinatorial Cell-Station Metamodels` (`c1s2`, `c1s4`, `c2s2`, `c2s4`, `c3s2`, `c3s3`, `c4s3`, `c4s4`)\n- **Validation Engine**: Evaluates ANN predictions against uploaded Rockwell Arena simulation logs (`Model_1.csv`, `Model_2.csv`, `Model_3.csv`) computing $R^2$, Mean Absolute Error (MAE), and Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE).\n- **Prescriptive Optimization Solver**: Grid/gradient search finding optimal arrival rates / setpoints to maximize throughput while keeping all stations below $85\\%$ utilization threshold.\n\n---\n\n### Charting & Visualization Upgrades\n\n#### [MODIFY] [chart_helpers.py](file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/neurax_app/utils/chart_helpers.py)\n- `ann_prediction_gauge()`: Real-time cyber neon gauge chart for predicted station utilization with bottleneck warning zones.\n- `ann_response_surface()`: 3D / 2D interactive response surface plot mapping input parameters vs predicted station load.\n- `ann_validation_scatter()`: Actual Arena Simulation vs. ANN Surrogate Predicted values with regression trendline and $R^2$ indicator.\n\n---\n\n### UI Integration\n\n#### [MODIFY] [app.py](file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/neurax_app/app.py)\n- Add a new high-tech tab: **\"Digital Twin (ANN Surrogate)\"** alongside \"Visual Inspection\", \"Production Analytics\", \"Root-Cause Intelligence\", and \"Cost & ROI\".\n- Interactive parameter sliders for real-time what-if scenario testing.\n- Live bottleneck alarm HUD: instant red/green indicator with prescriptive recommendations.\n- Comparison matrix against uploaded Rockwell Arena datasets.\n\n## Verification Plan\n\n### Automated Tests\n- Run unit test verifying mathematical equivalence between MATLAB formulas and Python NumPy implementation for sample test vectors across Model 1, Model 2, and Cell-Station models.\n\n### Manual Verification\n- Test interactive sliders in Streamlit UI.\n- Verify chart rendering with no Plotly layout conflicts.\n- Confirm zero emojis and clean futuristic styling.\n","Description":"Implementation plan for Digital Twin & ANN Surrogate Engine integration","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2\\implementation_plan.md","toolAction":"Writing implementation plan artifact","toolSummary":"Write implementation plan"}}]}
